{"id":"48092f0b07539137","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine.md","title":"ZFC Comp Oracle Machine","display":"df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine — ZFC Comp Oracle Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine"],"display":"df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine — ZFC Comp Oracle Machine","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comp-oracle-machine — ZFC Comp Oracle Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,A,Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}},\\rho\\in V\">\\(M,A,Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}},\\rho\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompOracleMachine}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompOracleMachine}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompOracleMachine}_S(M,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}},\\rho\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}},\\rho\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle)\n\\land q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land q_{?}\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\rho,\\omega,\\{q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n(\\rho(n)=q_{\\mathrm{yes}}\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\n\\land(\\rho(n)=q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\leftrightarrow n\\notin A)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompOracleMachine}_S(M,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\exists Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}},\\rho\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM=\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}},q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}},\\rho\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TM}_S(\\langle Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\rangle)\n\\land q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\in Q\n\\land|\\{q_{?},q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\}|=3\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land q_{?}\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\rho,\\omega,\\{q_{\\mathrm{yes}},q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n(\\rho(n)=q_{\\mathrm{yes}}\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\n\\land(\\rho(n)=q_{\\mathrm{no}}\\leftrightarrow n\\notin A)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The oracle reply map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> is kept separate from the finite tape-transition map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>; its argument is the queried natural number, not a tape symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","status":"resolve